Velora changes include the configurable bar and desktop layouts, appearance
presets, wallpaper services, expanded settings and toolbox, power management,
audio routing, and the Arch installer and update workflow. Project identity,
documentation and installation tooling were revised on 2026-10-23.

Upstream acknowledgements retained from Illogical Impulse:
- clsty: installation tooling and accessibility of the dotfiles.
- midn8hustlr: color generation improvements.
- outfoxxed: Quickshell and support for upstream development.
- Quickshell references: Soramane / caelestia-dots/shell,
  FridayFaerie/quickshell, and nydragon/nysh.
- Earlier AGS references: Aylur/dotfiles and kotontrion/dotfiles.
- Earlier EWW references: fufexan/dotfiles.
- Design inspirations: osu!lazer, Windows 11, AvdanOS and Material Design 3.

